        "body": "Hi @sarumaj!  This change makes sense to me, although it's a bit tricky to know side-efects from loading these non-DB users in these new locations, but it should be OK.\r\n\r\nThis PR shouldn't touch or change `asserts/go-licenses.json` -- please revert that change.  We won't be able to get a full test run with that change in place.\r\n\r\nOne minor change requested in tests; just a modernization change.\r\n"
